; DESCENT IS NOT DEPENDENCE — dd_child is fed by the same clock as dd_parent (it descended from the same
; world). A claim sets the parent's rotor at epoch 2; the child's rotor does not move. Lineage ≠ support.
[pulser:dd_clock](every 1){sig_out}
[spinner:dd_parent](w=16, n=8, rotor=quarter_turn_z, configurable){sig_in, socket}
[spinner:dd_child](w=16, n=8, rotor=quarter_turn_z, configurable){sig_in, socket}
[orb:dd_pv]{pose}
[orb:dd_cv]{pose}

[dd_clock] --sig--> {[dd_parent], [dd_child]}
[dd_parent] --socket--> [dd_pv]
[dd_child] --socket--> [dd_cv]
